# Project-specific
## Veloren
*.log
# Capture law (Fable, 2026-08-08): fan/probe evidence logs are
# attestation-bearing artifacts and must be versionable, not silently
# dropped by the blanket *.log rule above.
!bastion-test-evidence/**/*.log
*.rar
